  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-big-red-truck-v5.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "095603cd4e0b7710d0bf8d9d5e6d4222f290f7389d9806315a19bf8840bfe643",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "90b62a426fccd3fac46a40f2c93807d4330a725cf6fc94fe20e6183e19b0b563",
      "text": "Wukong and the\nBig Red Truck",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b80dc8fe88664cf18792fe3356ff4419d1bc801a1dfab3a60ac2ca8dd8a480ba",
      "text": "A big red truck rolled by.\n“Look at those wheels!”\nWukong’s tail went BOING!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7b23d03ed09bab482cb45131532f48cbe4f2443dd1d64f7c32ce0f913e9dce4c",
      "text": "At the station, Ben waved.\n“Come and have a look!”\nWukong had\nso many questions.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "45c955d07c25849b1532a0e24f7fc5512a4ba8710da9ef13bc80ae9a58583ea5",
      "text": "“Why the big boots?”\n“They help protect my feet.”\nWukong looked at his shoes.\n“Mine are only squeaky!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b296e9269c005d5f15c642d028e33d4475d87078d6d45e881f1df717543f31b8",
      "text": "Ben lent him a clean play hat.\nIt slipped over his eyebrows.\n“Do firefighters need eyes?”\n“Very much!” laughed Ben.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f2ae3140fab4a256c5bb0be618ff4b76d487f92c16b7379494deff1e98556aae",
      "text": "Ben showed his special mask.\n“It helps me breathe\nclean air.”\nHis voice sounded funny.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f5aa43470d672eaa94978690eb73b19f72b9d6869c74b290139d3167d608b817",
      "text": "“Still me!” said Ben.\nWukong waved back.\n“Hello, funny-voice Ben!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e1811b3be5cbdc8dc33c8c08340a237aff521f52f2a557a2c95514fd5d3649c4",
      "text": "“Is that a giant noodle?”\n“A hose!” said Ben.\n“It carries water.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "278ba06d191b22f1a88ddbd62f6d7f62bed8dab10264db8a7b95e6b78eafd1a2",
      "text": "Ben held the hose.\nWhoooosh went the water.\nOne tiny drop kissed\nWukong’s nose.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a2677fea38797251df38b5348a9b2cde41a926d6bdf7ebed5e63768c41c5b997",
      "text": "“And the ladder?”\n“It helps us reach up high.”\nWukong stayed down below.\nHis tail reached up.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "db2e84a3987b9caa80821743b60318e44fbb627e853a4bca5d8ea751df43a2f5",
      "text": "Then Ben showed an alarm.\n“Beep! Beep! Beep!”\n“That sound is a warning.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9acd03e8101af03ed8ef9b60900617a6526adf10139bcfcc69ada50b23e3818a",
      "text": "“If it beeps, go outside.”\nThey practiced the way out.\n“Then stay outside,” said Ben.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "633188c476c15b9ce4d798532c6401a480d57ff496bb88ad8c4a4262ad9b0f92",
      "text": "They chose a meeting tree.\n“Count noses!” said Wukong.\nPigsy counted his twice.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f53b42a06d0f686cb5027a287072e767196c457fd83c4f0e09843b23fc6f6224",
      "text": "Wukong thanked Ben.\n“Big truck. Big job.\nBig kind heart.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8f5d3fe45d219ebc6caebe8bdd9a14a4e5cb819d3e4295b3d80db6b6d4f5775f",
      "text": "At home, his toy truck went\nwee-oo… wee-oo…\nThen quieter.\nThen… shhh.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "68b1d4c03d12a07bff58e8017fc931c1b3bbc8f86c65e5eeae4c46d76f7524e9",
      "text": "He tucked in his toy truck.\n“Goodnight, helpers.”\nThe whole room felt quiet.\nSo did he.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
